# Database: Supabase only

This project uses **Supabase (Postgres)**. It does **not** use Azure PostgreSQL.

## Do not

- Call MCP `user-azure-postgresql-mcp` or any Azure PostgreSQL tools
- Assume Azure connection strings, Entra ID, or Azure MCP schemas apply here

## Do instead

- Schema / RLS / grants: read and edit files under `supabase/migrations/`
- App data access: Supabase client in the Nuxt app (`useSupabaseClient`, composables)
- Ad-hoc inspection: Supabase Dashboard or Supabase CLI — not Azure MCP
